        <p class="eyebrow"><span></span> Understanding the number</p>
        <h1 itemprop="headline">How WeekScale calculates your weekly average</h1>
        <p itemprop="description">How WeekScale turns daily readings into a weekly average, shows how complete the week is, and keeps the result useful in the context of normal day-to-day changes.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="guide-layout shell">
